#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:1
msgid "Agent admission policy"
msgstr "Agent 准入策略"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:3
msgid ""
"The Gateway decides who may use Cloud Agent. Cloud Agent represents the "
"account with its user ID and issuer, then checks the Gateway again on "
"each protected owner/admin request and on `/v1/session/me`."
msgstr ""
"谁能用 Cloud Agent，由网关说了算。Cloud Agent 用用户 ID "
"加签发方（issuer）来标识一个账号；每个受保护的所有者/管理员请求，以及 `/v1/session/me`，都会再向网关确认一次。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To get the current decision, Agent reads `GET /internal/users/{user_id"
"}/agent-access` over HTTP with its dispatch credential. The response "
"contains `user_id`, `allowed`, and `permissions`. Account roles and "
"profile fields are not authorization inputs."
msgstr ""
"要拿到最新的判定，Agent 会带上自己的 dispatch 凭据，通过 HTTP 请求 `GET "
"/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access`。响应里有 `user_id`、`allowed` 和 "
"`permissions`。账号角色和个人资料字段都不参与授权判断。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:12
msgid "Permissions and request checks"
msgstr "权限与请求检查"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Permission"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Access"
msgstr "允许访问的范围"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "`agent.use`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Owner APIs, subject to per-resource ownership checks"
msgstr "所有者 API，每个资源仍要单独检查所有权"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "`agent.admin`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid ""
"Gateway-authorized administration, including runner-host APIs; requires "
"`agent.use`"
msgstr "经网关授权的管理操作，包括 runner 主机相关的 API；必须同时拥有 `agent.use`"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:19
msgid ""
"`allowed` must agree with the presence of `agent.use`. Permissions must "
"be unique, use recognized values and include `agent.use` whenever "
"`agent.admin` is present. A decision for another user, or any malformed "
"or contradictory response, cannot grant access."
msgstr ""
"`allowed` 必须和有没有 `agent.use` 保持一致。权限列表不能重复，只能用认得的取值，并且有 `agent.admin` "
"就必须有 `agent.use`。如果判定针对的是另一个用户，或者响应格式不对、前后矛盾，一律不放行。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:24
msgid ""
"The FreeInference policy documented by the original rollout grants both "
"permissions to active admin accounts. Another deployment can register a "
"policy that admits other accounts without changing Agent. A neutral "
"Gateway with no registered policy denies access. Verify the policy in the"
" deployment being operated; this repository consumes its decision."
msgstr ""
"按最初上线时记录的 FreeInference 策略，这两项权限都授予状态正常的管理员账号。其他部署可以注册自己的策略，放行别的账号，不用改 "
"Agent。没有注册任何策略的中立网关会一律拒绝。请在你运维的那套部署里核实实际策略；本仓库只负责执行网关给出的判定。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An active account denied Agent permission can still sign in to see the "
"access-required page. Missing or inactive accounts cannot create a "
"session. Existing sessions recheck permissions on each protected "
"owner/admin request and on `/v1/session/me`. Owner requests may be "
"admitted on a grant the Gateway gave up to 10 seconds earlier "
"(`AGENT_ACCESS_ALLOW_TTL_S`): a page load sends a burst of owner "
"requests, and concurrent lookups for one account share a single Gateway "
"call. Only a grant is kept. A denial, an unknown account and an "
"unavailable Gateway are asked again on every request. Sign-in, "
"`/v1/session/me`, the admin surface and the checks made when a turn "
"starts never use a kept grant, and a denial `/v1/session/me` receives "
"ends the kept grant at once. The session response exposes `agent_access: "
"{allowed, permissions}`. The web app denies access if that field is "
"missing, including responses from an older backend."
msgstr ""
"状态正常、但没有 Agent "
"权限的账号仍然可以登录，登录后看到的是\"需要访问权限\"页面。不存在或已停用的账号无法建立会话。已有的会话在每个受保护的所有者/管理员请求和 "
"`/v1/session/me` 上都会重新检查权限。所有者请求可以沿用网关 10 "
"秒内给出的放行结果（`AGENT_ACCESS_ALLOW_TTL_S`）：打开一个页面会同时发出一批所有者请求，同一账号并发的查询只调用一次网关。只有\"放行\"会被缓存；拒绝、账号不存在、网关不可用这几种情况，每个请求都会重新问一遍。登录、`/v1/session/me`、管理接口，以及轮次开始时的检查，都不用缓存的放行结果；而且只要"
" `/v1/session/me` 收到一次拒绝，缓存的放行结果立刻作废。会话响应里带有 `agent_access: {allowed, "
"permissions}`。如果没有这个字段（包括旧版后端返回的响应），Web 应用会拒绝访问。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:43
msgid ""
"Checks govern admission of each request. A policy change does not itself "
"close an open stream or cancel a running job. An owner stream (a job's "
"events, the account's change feed, a terminal's output) is admitted when "
"it opens and ends after about 15 minutes. The client reconnects from "
"where it left off, and that request is admitted again, so a withdrawn "
"permission or an expired session stops a stream within that bound. Agent "
"keeps no permissions in a session, and an owner request's kept grant "
"lasts at most 10 seconds; the Gateway's account cache can still delay "
"direct database edits until its expiry. Ordinary Gateway account-"
"management operations invalidate that cache."
msgstr ""
"这些检查管的是每个请求能不能进来。策略变了，并不会自动关掉已经打开的流，也不会取消正在跑的任务。所有者的流（任务事件、账号的变更推送、终端输出）在打开时检查一次，大约"
" 15 分钟后自动结束。客户端会从断开的地方重新连接，这个新请求要再检查一次，所以权限被收回或会话过期后，流最多在这个时间内停止。Agent "
"不在会话里存权限，所有者请求缓存的放行结果最多保留 10 "
"秒。不过，网关自己的账号缓存在过期之前，可能还看不到直接改数据库造成的变化；通过网关正常的账号管理操作修改，则会让这份缓存立即失效。"

