msgstr "缺少身份配置、缺少访问端点，或 dispatch 凭据被拒绝"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "HTTP 503, typed `agent_configuration_error`; correct the deployment"
msgstr "HTTP 503，类型为 `agent_configuration_error`；需要修正部署配置"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
