#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:63
msgid ""
"When `/me` cannot confirm current access, the web app hides protected "
"content and offers a retry without forcing another sign-in. A callback "
"outage returns to the public login page with the original destination and"
" a retry action; the consumed login-flow cookie is cleared. Configuration"
" failures ask the operator to correct the deployment. An invalid `/me` "
"payload has its own explanation. Without a configured web destination, "
"the API retains its HTTP error response. Unverified state and consumed "
"authorization codes are never reused."
msgstr ""
"`/me` 无法确认当前的访问权限时，Web "
"应用会先把受保护的内容藏起来，并提供重试按钮，不强制重新登录。如果回调时服务出了故障，会回到公开的登录页，带上原来要去的地址和一个重试按钮，并清掉已经用过的登录流程"
" cookie。配置错误会提示运维人员修正部署。`/me` 返回的数据格式不对时，有专门的说明。没有配置 Web 跳转地址时，API 就直接返回 "
"HTTP 错误。未经验证的状态和用过的授权码，永远不会再次使用。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:71
msgid "Infrastructure credentials"
msgstr "基础设施凭据"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:73
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` independently authorizes infrastructure administration even"
" when the Gateway is unavailable. The on-call dispatch credential must "
"also pass the configured service account's `agent.use` check before "
"creating a job; its polling and cancellation access remains available for"
" cleanup. Host/worker credentials, attempt lease fences and owner checks "
"are separate controls."
msgstr ""
"即使网关不可用，`ADMIN_TOKEN` 也能单独授权基础设施管理。值班用的 dispatch 凭据在创建任务前，还必须通过所配置服务账号的 "
"`agent.use` 检查；它查询和取消任务的权限始终保留，方便清理。主机/worker 凭据、attempt "
"租约栅栏和所有者检查是彼此独立的几道控制。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:79
msgid ""
"Sessions carry minimal identity only. See [minimal identity](minimal-"
"identity.md) for cookie contents, issuer binding and upgrade constraints."
msgstr "会话只携带最少的身份信息。cookie 里有什么、签发方如何绑定、升级时有哪些限制，见[最小身份](minimal-identity.md)。"

