#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:97
msgid ""
"The probe queries a randomly named missing account and checks the real "
"403 against the schema and consumer. It creates no accounts and opens "
"neither database. It requires explicit Gateway credentials and is "
"excluded from default CI. Historical verification exercised the "
"production Gateway router/error handler from `c7987680` "
"(hybridInference#1408) through an isolated empty-store fixture over "
"loopback HTTP; it did not verify a live deployment."
msgstr ""
"这个探测会查询一个随机命名、实际不存在的账号，然后拿真实返回的 403 去对照 schema "
"和调用方。它不创建账号，也不打开任何一方的数据库。它需要显式提供网关凭据，默认的 CI 不会跑它。以前的验证是在回环 HTTP "
"上，用一个隔离的空存储夹具，跑了 "
"`c7987680`（hybridInference#1408）里生产网关的路由和错误处理；那次并没有验证线上部署。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:104
msgid "Rollout"
msgstr "上线步骤"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:106
msgid "For a deployment first adopting permission-based access:"
msgstr "一套部署第一次改用基于权限的访问控制时："

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:108
msgid "Configure its Gateway policy registration."
msgstr "在网关上注册好策略。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:109
msgid ""
"Release the Gateway policy hook and access endpoint together with "
"compatible distribution backend/frontend artifacts. Verify an admitted "
"account, an active account without permission, and a missing/inactive "
"account. Ensure the deployment's proxy routes the internal access path "
"correctly."
msgstr "把网关的策略钩子和访问端点，连同兼容的发行版前后端产物一起发布。分别用一个已放行的账号、一个状态正常但没有权限的账号，以及一个不存在或已停用的账号验证一遍。确认部署的代理能把内部访问路径转发到正确的地方。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:113
msgid ""
"Release Agent backend and web app together. Check fresh login, existing "
"sessions, owner APIs and administration."
msgstr "Agent 后端和 Web 应用一起发布。检查全新登录、已有会话、所有者 API 和管理功能。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:116
msgid ""
"A Gateway without the access endpoint is incompatible and causes "
"protected requests to fail closed. Do not add role-based fallback to "
"compensate. After adopting minimal identity, follow its [upgrade and "
"rollback constraints](minimal-identity.md#upgrade-an-existing-"
"deployment): older Agent binaries do not enforce the database issuer, and"
" profile-bearing cookies require a fresh login. Source changes alone do "
"not update pinned images or deploy either service."
msgstr ""
"没有访问端点的网关不兼容，受保护的请求会一律失败并拒绝访问。不要为了绕过这一点加基于角色的兜底逻辑。改用最小身份之后，要遵守它的[升级与回滚限制"
"](minimal-identity.md#upgrade-an-existing-deployment)：旧版 Agent "
"不会校验数据库里的签发方，而带有个人资料的旧 cookie 需要重新登录。光改源代码不会更新固定的镜像版本，也不会部署任何一个服务。"

